        <activityName xml:lang="en">Aluminiumtrihydroxide-acrylic glass, at plant</activityName>
        <generalComment>
          <text xml:lang="en" index="1">Full activity name: Aluminiumtrihydroxide-acrylic glass, at plant
The amount of hydrogen peroxide used for the initiation of the reaction is estimated. The electricity demand for cooling of the material is calculated with the heat capacity and the temperature difference.;
UUID: bc950be9-9bb8-34b3-9392-dfb391dc191b
This data set includes the materials needed for the production of aluminiumtrihydroxide-acrylic glass. Transport is estimated according to the ecoinvent standard distances for Switzerland.
Location: Data valid for Turkey
Technology: Average production
Time period: undefined
Production volume: na
Sampling: unknown 
Extrapolations: none
Uncertainty adjustments: none
BAFU mapped export: unsupported biosphere exchanges excluded; see audit/. Local UUIDs and generic activity classification are export conventions. Source: process_bc950be9-9bb8-34b3-9392-dfb391dc191b.xml</text>
